This chapter is in preparation. It describes the library's formulation of the Haag–Kastler axioms
on Minkowski spacetime: the local net of C\*-algebras on causal diamonds, isotony, local
commutativity, Lorentz covariance and the quasilocal algebra, with the theorems the library proves
about them.
